11: //   batch leave the buffer when it is sent and are never sent again, whatever
12: //   the answer (dropped under overload, never retried).
13: // - At most one request in flight per tab, aborted after REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS.
14: //   Requests start at least MIN_REQUEST_INTERVAL_MS apart (the route's budget
